        "Scent of Spring"
      ],
      "comment": "Ying'er: Timaeus and the Smoldersleet Potion",
      "content": "In the limited-time A Study in Potions event (2.4), Timaeus traced a \"Smoldersleet Elixir\" to Ying'er in Liyue; it turned out to be a popular perfume. She offered guidance that let him make a Smoldersleet Potion. She is modest about her own role, and Timaeus, flustered, begins to write her letters.",
