        "Timaeus's invitation"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Ying'er",
        "Windblume Festival"
      ],
      "comment": "Ying'er: Windblume's Breath",
      "content": "In the limited-time Windblume's Breath event (3.5), Timaeus vows to be honest until he wins her heart and invites her to Mondstadt, then gets caught up in helping others and forgets to meet her. Ying'er arrives on her own, half-scolds, then relents, telling him to call her Ying'er without \"Miss\". Afterwards they can be found near the Mondstadt crafting bench.",
