        "Red Dust Under Rolling Clouds"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Ying'er",
        "Lan Yan"
      ],
      "comment": "Ying'er: Springtime Charms",
      "content": "In the limited-time Springtime Charms event (5.3), Timaeus, who came to Liyue for the festival, fell ill, and Ying'er took him to Bubu Pharmacy, leaving Lan Yan to mind the shop. There Hu Tao bought Red Dust Under Rolling Clouds, a ritual-only perfume. Dr. Baizhu advised rest. Ying'er rewarded the Traveler and told Timaeus to rest.",
