        "Lantern Rite",
        "Scent of Spring"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Ying'er"
      ],
      "comment": "Ying'er: Lantern Rite greetings",
      "content": "At each Lantern Rite event (2.4, 3.4, 4.4, 5.3, 6.4, all limited) Ying'er greets the Traveler as an old acquaintance and promotes a seasonal gift. In 4.4 she suggests scenting the Traveler's kite; in 5.3 she jokes that the Traveler looks lovelier each time they meet; in 6.4 she asks about the Traveler's hopes for the year.",
